sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Haltian Sensors
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant H as Haltian Cloud
    participant ODE as Occupancy Processing
    participant API as Microsoft Graph API
    participant U as Teams / Outlook

    S->>GW: Occupancy measurements
    GW->>H: Forward via MQTT/HTTPS
    H->>ODE: Validated events
    Note over ODE: Single device: direct mapping<br/>Device group: Occupancy Data Engine
    ODE->>API: Occupancy state update
    API->>U: Room/desk availability
